; claude: OCaml read, not run (plan_tinybox_codemap.md), for a code
; visualizer: Token_ml (every token kept, comments too, with its
; place), Lexer_ml (ocamllex, after ocaml-light's lexer.mll) and
; Highlight_ml (each token's category, highlight/'s Highlight_code),
; Ast_ml and Parse_ml (the names and what they are, recursive descent,
; Parse_ml.mli says why not ocamlyacc).
;
; Pure OCaml, no Playground (languages/README.md). In the package
; tiny_languages, as tiny_languages.lang_ocaml.
(library
 (name lang_ocaml)
 (public_name tiny_languages.lang_ocaml)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules_without_implementation Ast_ml)
 (libraries highlight_code))

(ocamllex Lexer_ml)
